{"t":"ED","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Consolidated Edison, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":15407,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.conedison.com","summary_en":"Consolidated Edison, Inc., through its subsidiaries, engages in the regulated electric, gas, and steam delivery businesses in the United States. The company offers electric services to approximately 3.7 million customers in New York City and Westchester County; gas to approximately 1.1 million customers in Manhattan, the Bronx, parts of Queens, and Westchester County; and steam to approximately 1,490 customers in parts of Manhattan. It also supplies electricity to approximately 0.3 million customers in southeastern New York and northern New Jersey; and gas to approximately 0.1 million customers in southeastern New York. In addition, the company operates 552 circuit miles of transmission lines; 16 transmission substations; 63 distribution substations; 89,675 in-service line transformers; 3,764 pole miles of overhead distribution lines; and 2,417 miles of underground distribution lines, as well as 4,374 miles of mains and 379, 939 service lines for natural gas distribution. Further, it invests in electric and gas transmission projects. The company primarily sells electricity to industrial, commercial, residential, and government customers. Consolidated Edison, Inc. was founded in 1823 and is based in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Consolidated Edison, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 규제 대상인 전기, 가스 및 증기 공급 사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 뉴욕시와 Westchester 카운티의 약 370만 고객에게 전기 서비스를 제공합니다. 맨해튼, 브롱크스, 퀸즈 일부 및 웨스트체스터 카운티의 약 110만 고객에게 가스를 제공합니다. 맨해튼 일부 지역에서는 약 1,490명의 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 뉴욕 남동부와 뉴저지 북부의 약 30만 고객에게 전기를 공급합니다. 뉴욕 남동부의 약 10만 고객에게 가스를 공급합니다. 또한 회사는 552 회로 마일의 송전선을 운영하고 있습니다. 16개의 변전소; 63개의 배전 변전소; 89,675개의 서비스 라인 변압기; 3,764폴 마일의 가공 배전선; 2,417마일의 지하 배전선, 4,374마일의 본선, 379,939개의 천연가스 배전 서비스 라인이 있습니다. 또한 전기 및 가스 전송 프로젝트에도 투자합니다. 이 회사는 주로 산업, 상업, 주거 및 정부 고객에게 전기를 판매합니다. Consolidated Edison, Inc.는 1823년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕 주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":121.44,"mcap":44911992832.0,"pe":19.810766,"fpe":18.698236,"peg":2.3801,"ps":2.5389786,"pb":1.7470616,"ev_ebitda":11.646,"div":2.95,"beta":0.223,"hi52":122.75,"lo52":94.96},"fin":{"rev":17688999936.0,"rev_g":0.132,"eps_g":0.221,"gross":0.53372,"op":0.16540001,"net":0.12533,"roe":0.08962,"fcf":-844875008.0,"cash":1470000000.0,"debt":28320000000.0,"de":110.113,"eps":6.13,"feps":6.49473},"own":{"short":0.0424,"inst":0.78731,"insider":0.00202},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":107.38235,"median":108.0,"high":130.0,"low":87.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.15789,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":3,"strongSell":3},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":9,"sell":3,"strongSell":4},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":9,"sell":3,"strongSell":4}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":104.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-13","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":87.0,"priorPriceTarget":94.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-01","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":118.0,"priorPriceTarget":108.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-18","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":97.0,"priorPriceTarget":101.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-21","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":101.0,"priorPriceTarget":105.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-17","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":